Z||000007||beachbomb||05-16-2001||06:41 PM||||Hi, i did all three of those to my car, i removed the hood for the radiator, i used the new o2 sensor(it had that gunk on it, i didn't put anything else on it), and pull that fuse for the fuel pump and try to start the car like stated above, last thing you need if fuel everywhere, all three jobs where fairly easy, good luck..Jim(2 '84 Indys)||||reg||6
